WEBVTT

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.976
and they can't see and associate
it with somebody,

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.976
that person's probably not there.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.048
But the general idea
that you could only --

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.524
you could only really talk
about things in that place

00:08:40.548 --> 00:08:42.976
that had some kind of experimental basis.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.976
It didn't matter what Thomas Hobbes,

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.976
who was a local philosopher,

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.976
said about it, you know,

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.524
because you weren't going
to be talking final causes.

00:08:51.548 --> 00:08:52.976
What's happening here,

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.976
in the middle of the 17th century,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.976
was that what became my field --

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.976
science, experimental science --

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.976
was pulling itself away,